{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated product-page map: '<brand> <model>' -> the manufacturer's own page.",
    "",
    "Why this file exists: DuckDuckGo's html/lite endpoints answer HTTP 202 (bot",
    "challenge) from datacenter IPs and GSMArena's search (res.php3) sits behind a",
    "Cloudflare Turnstile check, so neither is dependable for automated lookup.",
    "This map supplies the page; the script then does the fetching, the model",
    "verification and the mobiles.html rewrite automatically.",
    "",
    "GSMArena is deliberately NOT used as the image source: its /vv/bigpic/ assets",
    "are hard-capped at 160x212 regardless of User-Agent or Referer, far below the",
    "300px minimum this project requires, and its og:image is that same thumbnail.",
    "",
    "A null means the device has no live product page on its manufacturer's site",
    "(delisted or region-only), so the product is left untouched. Add a URL only",
    "after confirming it returns HTTP 200 - the script still re-checks the page",
    "and the asset name against the exact model before accepting anything."
  ],

